			<Property name="English" value="The young of the species appear to be indistinguishable from other individuals, but refer to themselves as '&lt;STELLAR&gt;New Korvax Entity&lt;&gt;'. &#xA;&#xA;I was invited to watch. To report. To provide my observations on the process. Even the First Spawn did not understand how to forge new Korvax in this manner. &#xA;&#xA;The &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;carapace&lt;&gt; and the &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;nanite clusters&lt;&gt; undulate in the heart of the monolith. Three figures dance above a &lt;FUEL&gt;red orb&lt;&gt;. I break my contract. I look away." />
