			<Property name="Id" value="WAR_LIBRARY2_RESA" />
			<Property name="English" value="Justice is not a thought. It is not a river, ever-changing, ever running. Justice is the truth of the universe, the wish of &lt;FUEL&gt;ATLAS&lt;&gt;, the testament of &lt;SPECIAL&gt;HIRK&lt;&gt;.&#xA;&#xA;Like gravity, it brings itself into being. The task of the warrior is merely to fall, to feel its pull, to fire that weapon that must be fired." />
