			<Property name="Id" value="WAR_LIBRARY8_LANG" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;TRANS_EXP&gt;The Korvax&lt;&gt; are wounded, broken creatures, believing their death-cries are 'logic'. They drown themselves in communion to forget their pain. They shall not help us.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;TRANS_TRA&gt;The Gek&lt;&gt; - debased, accursed, lacking their prior might with no honour to replace it - believe nothing will end. That growth can go on forever. &#xA;&#xA;It has been to &lt;TRANS_WAR&gt;the Ancients&lt;&gt;, and those who followed, to discover our future. But what have they found, but dust? Impotent grahs? No." />
