			<Property name="English" value="There lie the dark stars, the vast oceans. My friends. &lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt; The moon rises. Grah! &lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt; The deep cries with the mourning of machines. &lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt; Grah! On Dryn'dargh, night falls without its people.&#xA;&#xA;To Dryn'dargh we will come back. I will come back. &lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt; I will not leave you. I will never leave you.&#xA;&#xA;I will remember. " />
